---
import SectionHR from "./SectionHR.astro";
---

<style>
  .about {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10rem 0;

    .bio-heading {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 100%;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .15em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .bio-paragraph {
      font-size: 1rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;

    }

    .bio-link {
      color: var(--grey);
      transition: color 0.25s ease-in-out;
      padding: .25rem;
      border-radius: 8px;

      &:hover,
      &:focus {
        color: var(--gold);
      }
    }
  }
</style> 

<section class="content-container about" id="about">
  <div class="bio-heading">
    <SectionHR />
    <h2 class="inter-200">bio</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="inter-200 bio-paragraph">I was born in the Upper Peninsula of Michigan, and grew up between the U.P. and Denver, Colorado. Since discovering programming in my early twenties, I've been a professional web developer for nearly a decade. My interests spread across front-end application development, UI/UX design, interactive development, API and server engineering, and even networking and linux systems.</p>
  <p class="inter-200 bio-paragraph">I also enjoy kayaking, fishing, tinkering with my car and my jeep, crafting of all sorts, and hanging out with my 9 cats, 3 dogs, and rabbit.</p>
  <p class="inter-200 bio-paragraph">I'm currently employed, building web applications at<a class="inter-500 bio-link" href="https://www.tilt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tilt</a>.</p>
</section>
